.<\/p>","button_label":"Optional button","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14486270771329__c8d3a8dc-5f1c-4abe-b8ed-b4a36c161544-16780335464e3da5f7-0","template--14486270771329__c8d3a8dc-5f1c-4abe-b8ed-b4a36c161544-16780335464e3da5f7-1","template--14486270771329__c8d3a8dc-5f1c-4abe-b8ed-b4a36c161544-16780335464e3da5f7-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"3cca54ba-cd33-46dd-99d7-a38ab0864d92":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486270771329__3cca54ba-cd33-46dd-99d7-a38ab0864d92-16780335464e3da5f7-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/diamrbbr_d_720x_487234f0-206a-4432-a693-98a11b8013ca.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"Diamond Runner Matting","text":"<p>This economical runner mat offers tough work surface protection and increased traction. Made out of recycled rubber, it has slip-resistant properties.<\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$4.20\/Sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy diamond runner matting","button_link":""}},"template--14486270771329__3cca54ba-cd33-46dd-99d7-a38ab0864d92-16780335464e3da5f7-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_95_1cc0f77d-f74e-4cf3-bc54-8bacaf2d63a1.png","image_width":650,"title":"PYRAMID RUNNER","text":"<p>The pyramid runner is an extremely slip resistant mat. The pyramid shapes provide for the perfect surface for creating grip and stability while reducing fatigue.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$5.66\/Sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy pyramid runner","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/pyramid-runner"}},"template--14486270771329__3cca54ba-cd33-46dd-99d7-a38ab0864d92-16780335464e3da5f7-2":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image_width":650,"title":"Example title","text":"<p>Use this section to explain a set of product features, to link to a series of pages, or to answer common questions about your products. Add images for emphasis.<\/p>","button_label":"Optional button","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14486270771329__3cca54ba-cd33-46dd-99d7-a38ab0864d92-16780335464e3da5f7-0","template--14486270771329__3cca54ba-cd33-46dd-99d7-a38ab0864d92-16780335464e3da5f7-1","template--14486270771329__3cca54ba-cd33-46dd-99d7-a38ab0864d92-16780335464e3da5f7-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"2a34d8fd-a6c4-497d-bc73-ae0c0d120826":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_101_ca4de2b7-ff3d-4aea-9172-4457adf5554e.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"Smooth Rubber Matting","text":"<p>This mat is a durable work surface or runner mat that keeps your industrial work surface smooth and safe. Made eco-friendly, the Smooth Rubber Matting is made with 43% recycled content and is also recyclable at the end of product life.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$5.66\/Sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy smooth rubber matting","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/smooth-rubber-matting","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"436ddfdd-7ccb-4f38-b251-6310b780b9cb":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486270771329__436ddfdd-7ccb-4f38-b251-6310b780b9cb-167803304369c6fd79-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"ribbed runner mats"}},"template--14486270771329__436ddfdd-7ccb-4f38-b251-6310b780b9cb-167803304369c6fd79-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>ribbed runner mats make excellent safety mats by providing sufficient grip and floor protection.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486270771329__436ddfdd-7ccb-4f38-b251-6310b780b9cb-167803304369c6fd79-0","template--14486270771329__436ddfdd-7ccb-4f38-b251-6310b780b9cb-167803304369c6fd79-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"a4809eee-7f1f-4d57-a59e-a6f2e2f46691":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486270771329__a4809eee-7f1f-4d57-a59e-a6f2e2f46691-16780335464e3da5f7-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_96_742d799b-e9d6-4deb-9286-c0b7e8221b05.png","image_width":650,"title":"WIDE RIB VINYL RUNNER","text":"<p>Wide ribbed runners are slightly better for foot traffic compared to the narrow ribbed mats which are designed for a higher degree of wheeled traffic. The vinyl material of this runner is easy to clean and wipe down.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$4.88\/Sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy wide rib vinyl runner","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/wide-rib-vinyl-runner"}},"template--14486270771329__a4809eee-7f1f-4d57-a59e-a6f2e2f46691-16780335464e3da5f7-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_97_fc4f6b94-5b80-4db2-8d95-4c5b2413ad65.png","image_width":650,"title":"VINYL CORRUGATED RUNNER","text":"<p>The narrower ribs in this vinyl runner allow a more even surface for smaller wheeled traffic. However, they are still suitable for foot traffic. The vinyl material of this runner is easy to clean and wipe down.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$3.83\/Sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy vinyl ribbed runner","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/vinyl-ribbed-runner"}},"template--14486270771329__a4809eee-7f1f-4d57-a59e-a6f2e2f46691-16780335464e3da5f7-2":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image_width":650,"title":"Example title","text":"<p>Use this section to explain a set of product features, to link to a series of pages, or to answer common questions about your products. Add images for emphasis.<\/p>","button_label":"Optional button","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14486270771329__a4809eee-7f1f-4d57-a59e-a6f2e2f46691-16780335464e3da5f7-0","template--14486270771329__a4809eee-7f1f-4d57-a59e-a6f2e2f46691-16780335464e3da5f7-1","template--1448627